-xs font-medium text-gray-600 group-hover:text-jade-500">兔</span></a><a class="group flex flex-col items-center p-3 rounded-xl border border-dark-600/50 hover:border-jade-400/50 transition-all duration-200" href="/shengxiao/"><span class="text-2xl mb-1">🐲</span><span class="text-xs font-medium text-gray-600 group-hover:text-jade-500">龙</span></a><a class="group flex flex-col items-center p-3 rounded-xl border border-dark-600/50 hover:border-jade-400/50 transition-all duration-200" href="/shengxiao/"><span class="text-2xl mb-1">🐍</span><span class="text-xs font-medium text-gray-600 group-hover:text-jade-500">蛇</span></a><a class="group flex flex-col items-center p-3 rounded-xl border border-dark-600/50 hover:border-jade-400/50 transition-all duration-200" href="/shengxiao/"><span class="text-2xl mb-1">🐴</span><span class="text-xs font-medium text-gray-600 group-hover:text-jade-500">马</span></a><a class="group flex flex-col items-center p-3 rounded-xl border border-dark-600/50 hover:border-jade-400/50 transition-all duration-200" href="/shengxiao/"><span class="text-2xl mb-1">🐏</span><span class="text-xs font-medium text-gray-600 group-hover:text-jade-500">羊</span></a><a class="group flex flex-col items-center p-3 rounded-xl border border-dark-600/50 hover:border-jade-400/50 transition-all duration-200" href="/shengxiao/"><span class="text-2xl mb-1">🐵</span><span class="text-xs font-medium text-gray-600 group-hover:text-jade-500">猴</span></a><a class="group flex flex-col items-center p-3 rounded-xl border border-dark-600/50 hover:border-jade-400/50 transition-all duration-200" href="/shengxiao/"><span class="text-2xl mb-1">🐔</span><span class="text-xs font-medium text-gray-600 group-hover:text-jade-500">鸡</span></a><a class="group flex flex-col items-center p-3 rounded-xl border border-dark-600/50 hover:border-jade-400/50 transition-all duration-200" href="/shengxiao/"><span class="text-2xl mb-1">🐶</span><span class="text-xs font-medium text-gray-600 group-hover:text-jade-500">狗</span></a><a class="group flex flex-col items-center p-3 rounded-xl border border-dark-600/50 hover:border-jade-400/50 transition-all duration-200" href="/shengxiao/"><span class="text-2xl mb-1">🐷</span><span class="text-xs font-medium text-gray-600 group-hover:text-jade-500">猪</span></a></div></section><div class="w-16 h-px mx-auto bg-dark-500/40 mb-14"></div><section id="heritage" class="mb-14"><div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto"><h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gold-600 font-serif mb-3 text-center">学派源流</h2><p class="text-center text-gray-500 text-sm mb-8 max-w-2xl mx-auto">千年命理智慧，承袭历代大家；本平台依古籍原文与学派传承为依据，AI 为你还原批命之道。</p><div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-4"><div class="border border-dark-600/50 rounded-xl p-4 hover:border-jade-400/40 transition-all duration-200"><p class="text-[10px] text-gray-500 mb-1">宋·北宋<!-- --> · <!-- -->紫微斗数</p><h3 class="text-base font-bold text-gold-600 font-serif">陈希夷</h3><p class="text-xs text-gray-500 italic mb-2">《紫微斗数全书》</p><p class="text-xs text-gray-500 leading-relaxed">华山道士，紫微斗数学派宗师。传于弟子白云先生，后散见于北宋元符年间刊本。</p></div><div class="border border-dark-600/50 rounded-xl p-4 hover:border-jade-400/40 transition-all duration-200"><p class="text-[10px] text-gray-500 mb-1">宋·北宋<!-- --> · <!-- -->梅花易数</p><h3 class="text-base font-bold text-gold-600 font-serif">邵康节</h3><p class="text-xs text-gray-500 italic mb-2">《梅花易数》</p><p class="text-xs text-gray-500 leading-relaxed">易学大家。创外应起卦法，化繁为简，后世奉为预测典范。</p></div><div class="border border-dark-600/50 rounded-xl p-4 hover:border-jade-400/40 transition-all duration-200"><p class="text-[10px] text-gray-500 mb-1">宋·南宋<!-- --> · <!-- -->紫微斗数</p><h3 class="text-base font-bold text-gold-600 font-serif">白玉蟾</h3><p class="text-xs text-gray-500 italic mb-2">《紫微斗数捷览》</p><p class="text-xs text-gray-500 leading-relaxed">道家南宗五祖之一。整理紫微斗数体系并广为传播。</p></div><div class="border border-dark-600/50 rounded-xl p-4 hover:border-jade-400/40 transition-all duration-200"><p class="text-[10px] text-gray-500 mb-1">汉<!-- --> · <!-- -->纳甲筮法</p><h3 class="text-base font-bold text-gold-600 font-serif">京房</h3><p class="text-xs text-gray-500 italic mb-2">《京氏易传》</p><p class="text-xs text-gray-500 leading-relaxed">创纳甲筮法，将天干地支融入卦象，六爻之鼻祖。</p></div><div class="border border-dark-600/50 rounded-xl p-4 hover:border-jade-400/40 transition-all duration-200"><p class="text-[10px] text-gray-500 mb-1">明·清<!-- --> · <!-- -->命理综合</p><h3 class="text-base font-bold text-gold-600 font-serif">刘伯温</h3><p class="text-xs text-gray-500 italic mb-2">《滴天髓》</p><p class="text-xs text-gray-500 leading-relaxed">注解传世，八字命理体系集大成者。其论「天道有寒暖，地道有燥湿」奠定五行气象理论。</p></div><div class="border border-dark-600/50 rounded-xl p-4 hover:border-jade-400/40 transition-all duration-200"><p class="text-[10px] text-gray-500 mb-1">明<!-- --> · <!-- -->三命通会</p><h3 class="text-base font-bold text-gold-600 font-serif">万民英</h3><p class="text-xs text-gray-500 italic mb-2">《三命通会》</p><p class="text-xs text-gray-500 leading-relaxed">明代命理百科全书。神煞、纳音、起运诸法尽收其中。</p></div></div><p class="text-center text-[10px] text-gray-600 mt-6">古籍原文已过版权保护期；现代命理师注解内容均自行重写，仅引用书名与简短背景。</p></div></section><div class="w-16 h-px mx-auto bg-dark-500/40 mb-14"></div><section class="mb-14"><h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gold-600 font-serif mb-4 text-center">🔮 全部工具</h2><div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 xl:grid-cols-4 gap-4"><a class="group rounded-xl border border-dark-600/50 p-5 hover:border-jade-400/60 transition-all duration-200" href="/bazi/"><div class="text-3xl mb-3 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-200">📜</div><h3 class="text-base font-semibold text-gray-800 group-hover:text-jade-500 transition-colors mb-1">四柱八字</h3><p class="text-xs text-gray-500 leading-relaxed mb-2">根据出生年月日时推算四柱命盘，解读命运格局</p><p class="text-[10px] text-gold-900 font-serif italic">《滴天髓》《三命通会》</p></a><a class="group rounded-xl border border-dark-600/50 p-5 hover:border-jade-400/60 transition-all duration-200" href="/ziwei/"><div class="text-3xl mb-3 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-200">⭐</div><h3 class="text-base font-semibold text-gray-800 group-hover:text-jade-500 transition-colors mb-1">紫微斗数</h3><p class="text-xs text-gray-500 leading-relaxed mb-2">紫微斗数命盘排盘，十二宫星曜分析</p><p class="text-[10px] text-gold-900 font-serif italic">《紫微斗数全书》</p></a><a class="group rounded-xl border border-dark-600/50 p-5 hover:border-jade-400/60 transition-all duration-200" href="/zonghe-zhengming/"><div class="text-3xl mb-3 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-200">🔗</div><h3 class="text-base font-semibold text-gray-800 group-hover:text-jade-500 transition-colors mb-1">综合印证</h3><p class="text-xs text-gray-500 leading-relaxed mb-2">八字+紫微交叉对账，六维印证</p></a><a class="group rounded-xl border border-dark-600/50 p-5 hover:border-jade-400/60 transition-all duration-200" href="/liuyao/"><div class="text-3xl mb-3 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-200">☯</div><h3 class="text-base font-semibold text-gray-800 group-hover:text-jade-500 transition-colors mb-1">六爻</h3><p class="text-xs text-gray-500 leading-relaxed mb-2">六爻起卦预测，卦象解读吉凶祸福</p><p class="text-[10px] text-gold-900 font-serif italic">《周易》《断易天机》</p></a><a class="group rounded-xl border border-dark-600/50 p-5 hover:border-jade-400/60 transition-all duration-200" href="/jiemeng/"><div class="text-3xl mb-3 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-200">💤</div><h3 class="text-base font-semibold text-gray-800 group-hover:text-jade-500 transition-colors mb-1">周公解梦</h3><p class="text-xs text-gray-500 leading-relaxed mb-2">梦境解析，探索潜意识的奥秘</p><p class="text-[10px] text-gold-900 font-serif italic">《周公解梦全书》</p></a><a class="group rounded-xl border border-dark-600/50 p-5 hover:border-jade-400/60 transition-all duration-200" href="/fengshui/"><div class="text-3xl mb-3 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-200">🧭</div><h3 class="text-base font-semibold text-gray-800 group-hover:text-jade-500 transition-colors mb-1">风水罗盘</h3><p class="text-xs text-gray-500 leading-relaxed mb-2">八宅风水、九宫飞星、房屋布局分析</p><p class="text-[10px] text-gold-900 font-serif italic">《青囊经》《葬书》</p></a><a class="group rounded-xl border border-dark-600/50 p-5 hover:border-jade-400/60 transition-all duration-200" href="/chenggu/"><div class="text-3xl mb-3 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-200">⚖️</div><h3 class="text-base font-semibold text-gray-800 group-hover:text-jade-500 transition-colors mb-1">称骨测算</h3><p class="text-xs text-gray-500 leading-relaxed mb-2">袁天罡称骨法，测算一生福禄</p><p class="text-[10px] text-gold-900 font-serif italic">《袁天罡称骨歌》</p></a><a class="group rounded-xl border border-dark-600/50 p-5 hover:border-jade-400/60 transition-all duration-200" href="/xingzuo/"><div class="text-3xl mb-3 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-200">♈</div><h3 class="text-base font-semibold text-gray-800 group-hover:text-jade-500 transition-colors mb-1">星座</h3><p class="text-xs text-gray-500 leading-relaxed mb-2">十二星座每日运势和性格分析</p><p class="text-[10px] text-gold-900 font-serif italic">西方占星术</p></a><a class="group rounded-xl border border-dark-600/50 p-5 hover:border-jade-400/60 transition-all duration-200" href="/qimen/"><div class="text-3xl mb-3 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-200">🌀</div><h3 class="text-base font-semibold text-gray-800 group-hover:text-jade-500 transition-colors mb-1">奇门遁甲</h3><p class="text-xs text-gray-500 leading-relaxed mb-2">三奇八门排盘预测吉凶</p><p class="text-[10px] text-gold-900 font-serif italic">《奇门遁甲秘笈大全》</p></a><a class="group rounded-xl border border-dark-600/50 p-5 hover:border-jade-400/60 transition-all duration-200" href="/meihua/"><div class="text-3xl mb-3 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-200">🌸</div><h3 class="text-base font-semibold text-gray-800 group-hover:text-jade-500 transition-colors mb-1">梅花易数</h3><p class="text-xs text-gray-500 leading-relaxed mb-2">万物皆可占的易学方法</p><p class="text-[10px] text-gold-900 font-serif italic">《梅花易数》</p></a><a class="group rounded-xl border border-dark-600/50 p-5 hover:border-jade-400/60 transition-all duration-200" href="/lingqian/"><div class="text-3xl mb-3 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-200">🏮</div><h3 class="text-base font-semibold text-gray-800 group-hover:text-jade-500 transition-colors mb-1">灵签</h3><p class="text-xs text-gray-500 leading-relaxed mb-2">在线抽签，观音灵签吕祖灵签</p><p class="text-[10px] text-gold-900 font-serif italic">《观音灵签》《吕祖灵签》</p></a><a class="group rounded-xl border border-dark-600/50 p-5 hover:border-jade-400/60 transition-all duration-200" href="/xingming/"><div class="text-3xl mb-3 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-200">📝</div><h3 class="text-base font-semibold text-gray-800 group-hover:text-jade-500 transition-colors mb-1">姓名打分</h3><p class="text-xs text-gray-500 leading-relaxed mb-2">姓名五格数理分析，起名改名参考</p><p class="text-[10px] text-gold-900 font-serif italic">《五格剖象法》</p></a><a class="group rounded-xl border border-dark-600/50 p-5 hover:border-jade-400/60 transition-all duration-200" href="/shuma/"><div class="text-3xl mb-3 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-200">🔢</div><h3 class="text-base font-semibold text-gray-800 group-hover:text-jade-500 transition-colors mb-1">号码测吉凶</h3><p class="text-xs text-gray-500 leading-relaxed mb-2">手机号、车牌号等数字能量分析</p><p class="text-[10px] text-gold-900 font-serif italic">《数字能量学》</p></a><a class="group rounded-xl border border-dark-600/50 p-5 hover:border-jade-400/60 transition-all duration-200" href="/huangli/"><div class="text-3xl mb-3 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-200">📅</div><h3 class="text-base font-semibold text-gray-800 group-hover:text-jade-500 transition-colors mb-1">黄历择日</h3><p class="text-xs text-gray-500 leading-relaxed mb-2">每日黄历宜忌查询，择吉日良辰</p><p class="text-[10px] text-gold-900 font-serif italic">传统通书</p></a><a class="group rounded-xl border border-dark-600/50 p-5 hover:border-jade-400/60 transition-all duration-200